# tests/fixtures/abi/t4_rows.golden — GB-073 shared row-name set.
#
# The ONE list both probes consume.  The M1 -V DoDs (GB-016-V, GB-017-V, ...)
# name these rows; the device probe (src/user/t4_probe.c, leg A/Linux and
# leg B/HobbyOS-intel) and the host model (src/host/t4_compat_probe.c) must each
# carry EXACTLY this set.  A row the DoDs name but a probe cannot emit, or a
# probe that emits a row the other does not, is a disagreement the --check must
# FAIL — never a smaller diff that passes.  Deleting a row here or in a probe
# fails the gate.
#
# One name per line, no trailing whitespace.  Auto-checked by
# tools/gate/t4_device.sh --check.
